WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.993
A sentence, you can read back. A picture, you cannot.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.632
So Sprezzature renders what it drew,

3
00:00:06.632 --> 00:00:08.099
then actually looks at it.

4
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.383
Ten skills, one loop, five ways in.

5
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.561
It even auditions the model it hires.

6
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.931
Sprezzature. Make it, audit it, then look at it.
